      "path": "/books/maani-al-akhbar:253:1",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/255/1",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا سعد بن عبد الله، قال: حدثني إبراهيم بن هاشم عن إسماعيل بن مرار، عن يونس بن عبد الرحمن، قال: حدثني جماعة من أصحابنا، عن أبي عبد الله عليه السلام قال: الكفؤ أن يكون عفيفا وعنده يسار."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "1.\tMy father, may Allah grant him mercy, said: We were told by Sa’d bin Abdullah, that he said: I was told by Ibrahim bin Hashim, from Isma’eel bin Marrar, from Yunus bin Abdul-Rahman, that he said: I was told by a group of our companions, from Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, that he said: The proficient is the one who is chaste and who has solvency."
        ]
      }
